.vscode/**
.gitignore
**/*.map

# data/api.json ships; the generator that writes it does not. `gen/` holds a Go program,
# its module file and an 11 MB compiled copy of it — build tooling for whoever changes the
# standard library, and eleven megabytes of nothing for whoever installs the extension.
data/gen/**

# The packages themselves: `vsce package` must not fold the previous release into the
# next one.
*.vsix
